    "bio": [
      "I’m an electronic music producer first. I make music as [Veff](https://open.spotify.com/artist/23UNzX4bA5gyBVfsEkhcrl) — earlier as [Batme](https://open.spotify.com/artist/4gFF0d85BJ1uBuSKX39F2F) — and I’ve composed music for film.",
      "The OP–XY is at the centre of how I write. I bought it in the first minute it went on sale; I love teenage engineering’s instruments and own every one of them — even the old IKEA Frekvens speakers and the Playdate. Open-XY Mods by Veff is where the tools I wish it had end up: Linear by Veff first, and machines like Seed, Granular and the Veff effects.",
      "Today I work as an art director in games.",
      "Before that I was an iOS developer: I designed and built apps end to end, and my work received Apple Design Awards. I spent many years as a 2D and 3D artist too, and UX design runs through all of it — how something feels to use matters to me as much as how it works."
    ],
